| --- | --- |
| BP child SkeletalMesh | `/Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleCharacter/PS_Prismatica_Humanoid_Base_Mesh` |
| Native parent CDO SkeletalMesh | `null` |
| PIE world | `M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification` |
| DeformComponents | `1` |
| Character profile | `OnlyFeet` |
| DrawStrength | `1.5` |
| `Prismatiscape_Deform_RT` | center 64x64 area `86 / 4096`, max abs `0.99853515625` |

## Cook/Stage/Smoke

Runtime C++ changed, so game target build is required before runnable smoke.

First smoke without rebuilding game target failed with exit code `3` because the staged executable used the old native class layout and could not deserialize the newly cooked BP. The log showed:

```text
Serialization error - FName are serialized as an index recorded in the package header
Array index out of bounds
```

The helper now has `-BuildGame` for this case.

최종 명령:

```powershell
.\scripts\cook_prismatiscape_clean_map.ps1 `
  -Map /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification `
  -BuildGame `
  -SmokeLaunch `
  -SmokeTimeoutSeconds 60
```

결과:

| 항목 | 값 |
| --- | --- |
| Game target build | `Succeeded` |
| BuildCookRun | `BUILD SUCCESSFUL` |
| Target map entries | `2` |
| Character deform BP | `2` |
| PrismatiscapeStudy entries | `6` |
| `_MCP_Temp` | `0` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap` | `0` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMaterials` | `0` |
| Prismatiscape ExampleCharacter | `8` |
| Prismatiscape YeetoMosquito | `2` |
| Prismatiscape CloudNoise | `3` |
| Prismatiscape plugin Demo entries | `13` |
| Staged GameDefaultMap | `/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification.M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification` |
| Source GameDefaultMap | `/Game/UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap.DemoMap` |
| Smoke launch exit code | `0` |

Smoke log proof:

```text
LoadMap: /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification?Name=Player
FPlatformMisc::RequestExitWithStatus(0, 0, UGameEngine::HandleExitCommand)
```

남은 cook warning은 기존과 같다.

- Lumen project setting priority warning 2건.
- plugin `Prismatiscape_SimulationProfile`의 `/Script/PrismatiscapeEditor` VerifyImport warning 1건.
